From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nishith Khanna <nishithkhanna@e.email>
Date: Tue, 20 Jan 2026 20:04:16 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 06/24] SystemUI: Theme according to our palette

Theme quick settings to match our palette
Theme switches in various sub dialogs in quick settings
Theme screen record dialog
Theme internet dialog
Theme power menu

[a17: /e/ colours re-applied onto the Android 17 resources (which moved from
 @androidprv:color to @color/materialColor* tokens); QS shade/under-surface use
 the day/night e_qs aliases because a17 has no night QuickSettings style; the
 clipboard chip text uses e_background (overlayButtonTextColor is gone);
 global_actions_lite and media_dialog colours stay as a17 defines them; three
 files removed upstream are not re-added]

(cherry picked from commit d14df14b509c48d78b9b7f3bb820f33dd6b6365a)
